                                                "sense_id": "dd7fd179-d769-3df5-a76e-07cbaf0831f0",
                                                "text": "[…] Mosse argued the most fascist and totalitarian in particular but also radical Jacobin regimes, continued to have an investment in not merely disciplining human bodies but harnessing their sense of glory toward worshiping themselves […]"
